{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里仍没底\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得接下那一步后确实有了力气，可心里的牵挂还在。\",\n      \"key\": \"牵挂还在\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"text\": \"想到那种不用时时防备的生活，他会安稳些，可光想着它，妨碍它的事不会消失。\",\n      \"key\": \"光想着它\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他又想怪自己不够坚定，可他真想留住那种安宁，也不愿放下眼前该争取的事，两边都在乎才让他为难。\",\n      \"key\": \"两边都在乎\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他想到争取可能耗掉温柔，心里还是疼，也盼着少伤一点的办法，可眼前该争取的事不能一直搁着。\",\n      \"key\": \"耗掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍怕争取会伤到珍惜的东西，也舍不得安宁，却没等心里安稳下来，就先接下眼前该担的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下眼前该担的事\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"承接前段逼自己立刻选边的劲稍松这一变化，保留心里没底却开始重新考虑能承担什么，为从试探到行动留下起点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动曾带来力量却没有消除牵挂的亲身经验，压缩重复的行动赋能说明，并指回 S02-2。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿真实带给他的安稳，同时接回 S07-2 中珍惜的生活仍受威胁的经历，说明怀念不能代替实际保护。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把两边都真实、自责和争取可能伤到安宁的意思收拢。S11-4 明说他真想留住安宁，也放不下眼前该争取的事，难处来自两边都在乎；S11-5 保留行动可能耗掉温柔的代价。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-3\", \"S11-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并落到眼前的处境\",\n      \"why\": \"保留心疼争取的代价、盼着少伤一点的办法，以及不行动也未必保得住珍惜之物的认识。用眼前的事不能一直搁着替代泛化的等待格言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"合并带着恐惧行动和不再让恐惧决定的重复表达，落到心里尚未安稳便接下眼前该担的事，保留恐惧未消而停滞开始松动的变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "196fc7c5-cb1b-43ef-a6e5-27b573e3f791", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131946318350Z", "elapsed_seconds": 946.328, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:35:32.655291+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "42a8985f3524ab1a28d1b6ceeff69851d142c68e1a7f5b8de470d61e2ee8790d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T131946318350Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "95220d902a123f8dc46b172279c3061443ce77e30869687397bb5fbc7537562e"}}}
